Tool response:
Tool: run_cross_batch_duplicate_check
Description: Identifies potential fraud duplicates by comparing invoices from two different payment runs 
for the same carrier. Matches are based on invoice number and amount, but origin ZIP and weight must differ.
Parameters:
    {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "payment_run_code_1": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "First payment run code",
          "title": "Payment Run Code 1"
        },
        "payment_run_code_2": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "Second payment run code",
          "title": "Payment Run Code 2"
        },
        "carrier_code": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "Carrier code",
          "title": "Carrier Code"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "payment_run_code_1",
        "payment_run_code_2",
        "carrier_code"
      ]
    }

Tool response:
Tool: classify_potential_fraud_duplicates
Description: Creates audit exception records for identified potential fraud duplicates.
Assigns exception type 'INCONSISTENT_SHIPMENT_CONTEXT'.
Parameters:
    {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "invoice_pairs": {
          "items": {
            "properties": {
              "invoice_id_1": {
                "type": "integer",
                "title": "Invoice Id 1"
              },
              "invoice_id_2": {
                "type": "integer",
                "title": "Invoice Id 2"
              }
            },
            "type": "object",
            "required": [
              "invoice_id_1",
              "invoice_id_2"
            ],
            "title": "InvoicePairInput"
          },
          "type": "array",
          "title": "Invoice Pairs"
        },
        "created_by": {
          "type": "integer",
          "title": "Created By"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "invoice_pairs",
        "created_by"
      ]
    }
